After 185 days of development, I'm finally ready to announce that Roguenarok will set sail on Steam this coming December 11, 2023, 10:00Am PST.  Thank you all so much for your support!

[previewyoutube=U7VS5vEeLT4;full][/previewyoutube]

[h2]New things that are added:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Controller Support
[*] 3+ Languages (Simplified Chinese, Japanese, and English)
[*] Improve overall balance to enemies, weapons, and items.
[*] Added 3 types of difficulties for Battle Arena and Survival mode
[/list]

[b]I would love to give a very special thanks to:[/b]
@RedDuelist
@JustDaZack

Thank you so much for your feedback about the balance of enemies and weapons. I owe you my deepest gratitude!

